[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904341215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106714#issuecomment-2904341215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106714","id":2904341215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tHLrf","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T12:57:33Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T12:57:33Z","body":"As I suggested in the issue, it would be better to save only the scenes in the list, instead of using `_save_all_scenes()`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904341215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904478385","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106714#issuecomment-2904478385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106714","id":2904478385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tHtKx","user":{"login":"jorgekorgut","id":70108521,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTA4NTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70108521?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut","html_url":"https://github.com/jorgekorgut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T13:45:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T14:19:32Z","body":"@KoBeWi Thanks for your feedback.\r\n\r\nI have been reading the code for a while and I found just one reference containing the information of external unsaved files. This tree, called```disk_changed_list```, keeps reference of the string of the scenes names ? (not so sure about it) and I think it is only used for the UI.\r\n\r\nJust to be sure you have spotted, calling the ```_save_all_scenes()``` does actually the saving scene logic only for the lists that are not saved in the editor ```_is_scene_unsaved()``` AND with this pull request scenes that were externally modified ```_is_scene_externally_modified()```.\r\n\r\nDo you still would prefer a new function like ```_save_scene(i)``` that is called somewhere for every externally modified files ? (dont know where or how do you want this function to be called)\r\n\r\n## Edit : \r\n\r\nReading the code again, I can see that _save_all_scenes() call ```_save_scene(String, i)``` for only the scenes that need an update. I see 2 ways of changing it to match what you suggested but I dont see any advantages when compared with what I I have implemented.\r\n\r\nSuggestion 1 :\r\nHaving another list synchronised with ```disk_changed_list``` that keeps track of the index of lists that need to be saved. And then call ```_save_scene(String, i)``` for those scenes that needs to be modified.\r\n\r\nSuggestion 2:\r\nHaving a outer loop (iterating over all scenes) in ```_resave_scenes()``` (I would rename it into ```_resave_externally_modified_scenes()```) that checks if a scene needs to be saved and only call the ```_save_scene(String, i)``` if it needs to.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904478385/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904597075","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106714#issuecomment-2904597075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106714","id":2904597075,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tIKJT","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T14:22:54Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T14:22:54Z","body":"`_save_scene()` already exists and takes a scene path (index is optional), so you can use that.\r\n\r\nThe reason I think it's better to save only modified scenes is that this information is already available. `_save_all_scenes()` is used in other places too (e.g. when running project), and with your current code it will perform unnecessary check.\r\n\r\nI'd go with your suggestion 1. You can add a `LocalVector<String>` with paths of the scenes (the same ones as added to `disk_changed_list`).\r\nAlternatively you can reuse `disk_changed_list`, since it already has all the scene paths. However it may contain not only scenes, so you'd have to mark items whether they are a scene or not. While it would work, the above solution sounds cleaner.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904597075/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2905609115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106714#issuecomment-2905609115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106714","id":2905609115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tMBOb","user":{"login":"jorgekorgut","id":70108521,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTA4NTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70108521?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut","html_url":"https://github.com/jorgekorgut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgekorgut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T19:40:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T19:40:04Z","body":"Note that the project is also saved only if it was externally modified. I assumed that it should work this way.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2905609115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2910228676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106714#issuecomment-2910228676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106714","id":2910228676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tdpDE","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.c